{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1478914-do-hsien-and-other-gallain-produce-kineans","id":1478914,"title":"Do Hsien and other Gallain produce kineans?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Changeling: The Dreaming"],"posts":[{"date":"2022-04-15T10:22:55-07:00","id":1478914,"title":"Do Hsien and other Gallain produce kineans?","content":"Basically Title, but also a question on how they would work.<br /> <br /> For kinean like the nunnehi, it's kind of easy to just change glamour to medicine, but for the hsien it's more up in the air.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6383-prometheas","name":"Prometheas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-15T17:23:34-07:00","id":1478927,"title":"","content":"Hsien didn't because they were human corpses inhabited by one of the little gods (not sure if this is going to change later, given how the Year of the Lotus stuff is getting handled in the various fifth editions). Inanimae didn't because they were elemental in substance. Anyone that's more like the kithain, like the selkies, probably produces part-fae offspring as the kithain do.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-15T18:47:36-07:00","id":1478930,"title":"","content":"There are in cannon selkie kineans. And I remember mention of Menehune kineans. Which supports Saur Ops Specialist.<br /> <br /> In the case of Selkie Kineans, all selkies are Kineans until they receive their seal &quot;skin.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2022-04-15T22:43:06-07:00","id":1478936,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/changeling-the-dreaming/1478914-do-hsien-and-other-gallain-produce-kineans?p=1478927#post1478927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hsien didn't because they were human corpses inhabited by one of the little gods (not sure if this is going to change later, given how the Year of the Lotus stuff is getting handled in the various fifth editions).</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah. C20 is just pretty agnostic on details, to the point that hsien aren't strictly mortal corpses anymore. It's not really clear how kinean function in C20 to begin with(for example: do they have a permanent glamour score? can they raise it with XP? etc.).<br /> <br /> With how sparse the c20 book is, you can technically make a functioning hsien Kinian using the rules as presented. Just substitute the permanent glamour score with yin and yang, drop banality, and give them a maximum yugen pool of 2. Fae blood would work as intended for hsien arts(and funnily enough, there are 6 hsien arts. so a Faery Blood 5 Hsien kinian could be a being of respectable power in the Hsien community).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":6383,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6383-prometheas","user":"Prometheas","date":". 04-16-2022, 02:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6383-prometheas","name":"Prometheas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1101"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}